  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "A spooky old hack that makes use of the SMB3 disassembly to do more than what&#039;s normally possible!\r\n\r\n* Use your new BOMB power up to take aim! Holding up or down will allow you to target higher or lower creatures!\r\n* Three special new powers, two only found in the bonus level!\r\n* Be the Princess, and kick butt! \r\n\r\nHack by Darkdata, 2013.\r\n\r\nStory:\r\nA Mario Party Board is cursed by one of Bowser&#039;s sons!\r\nDefeat him in order to save the day!\r\n\r\nNote:\r\nPatch with LUNAR IPS (LIPS.exe) unto a PRG0 SMB3 Rom.\r\nIt _must_ be (PRG0), or it will not work!"
    }
  ],
